<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Proofs</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Here, we provide full theoretical derivation and missing proofs for Section <a href="#S4" title="4 Theoretical Analysis: Occupancy-Based Bound" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<section id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Setup and notation.</h4>

<div id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Let <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(x_{0},x_{1})\sim\pi" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>∼</mo><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(x_{0},x_{1})\sim\pi</annotation></semantics></math> be a coupling between source and data
(e.g., <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pi(x_{0},x_{1})=p_{0}(x_{0})\,p_{\text{data}}(x_{1})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>data</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pi(x_{0},x_{1})=p_{0}(x_{0})\,p_{\text{data}}(x_{1})</annotation></semantics></math>),
and let <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\sim\mathrm{Unif}[0,1]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∼</mo><mrow><mi>Unif</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\sim\mathrm{Unif}[0,1]</annotation></semantics></math>.
The finite state space is <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{S}=\mathcal{V}^{L}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒱</mi><mi>L</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{S}=\mathcal{V}^{L}</annotation></semantics></math>, where <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{V}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒱</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{V}</annotation></semantics></math> is the
vocabulary of tokens and <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="L" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>L</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">L</annotation></semantics></math> the sequence length.
For each <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>t</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{t}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="q_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q_{t}</annotation></semantics></math> are probability distributions on <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{S}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{S}</annotation></semantics></math>. During training, <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.m11" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="p_{t}(\cdot\mid x_{0},x_{1})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{t}(\cdot\mid x_{0},x_{1})</annotation></semantics></math> denotes the designed conditional path;
during generation, the model defines <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.m12" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="q_{t}(\cdot\mid x_{0})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q_{t}(\cdot\mid x_{0})</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p2.1" class="ltx_p">We define the <em id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p2.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">occupancies</em>, which can be measured either at the sequence
or site level, using the marginal path distributions:</p>
<table id="A1.EGx3" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex6"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mu_{\mathcal{D}}(t,x_{t}):=\lambda(t)\,p_{t}(x_{t}),\quad\mu_{\mathrm{gen}}(t,x_{t}):=\lambda(t)\,q_{t}(x_{t})," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>:=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="1.167em">,</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi>gen</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>:=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mu_{\mathcal{D}}(t,x_{t}):=\lambda(t)\,p_{t}(x_{t}),\quad\mu_{\mathrm{gen}}(t,x_{t}):=\lambda(t)\,q_{t}(x_{t}),</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p3.1" class="ltx_p">where <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda=\mathrm{Unif}[0,1]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>Unif</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda=\mathrm{Unif}[0,1]</annotation></semantics></math> is the base time measure,
and</p>
<table id="A1.Ex7" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p_{t}(x_{t})=\sum_{x_{0},x_{1}}\pi(x_{0},x_{1})\,p_{t}(x_{t}\mid x_{0},x_{1})," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.111em">=</mo><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></munder><mrow><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{t}(x_{t})=\sum_{x_{0},x_{1}}\pi(x_{0},x_{1})\,p_{t}(x_{t}\mid x_{0},x_{1}),</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<table id="A1.Ex8" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="q_{t}(x_{t})=\sum_{x_{0}}p_{0}(x_{0})\,q_{t}(x_{t}\mid x_{0})." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.111em">=</mo><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></munder><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q_{t}(x_{t})=\sum_{x_{0}}p_{0}(x_{0})\,q_{t}(x_{t}\mid x_{0}).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p4" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p4.1" class="ltx_p">On the finite state space <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{S}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{S}</annotation></semantics></math>, let <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x,z\in\mathcal{S}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x,z\in\mathcal{S}</annotation></semantics></math> denote states.
The (target) probability velocity field is written as <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p4.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="u_{t}(x,z)\geq 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u_{t}(x,z)\geq 0</annotation></semantics></math> for <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p4.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="z\neq x" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>≠</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">z\neq x</annotation></semantics></math>, which
represents the instantaneous probability flow from <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p4.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>x</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x</annotation></semantics></math> to <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p4.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="z" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>z</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">z</annotation></semantics></math> and governs
the evolution of <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p4.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>. The learned model velocity is denoted <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p4.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="u_{t}^{\theta}(x,z)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>θ</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u_{t}^{\theta}(x,z)</annotation></semantics></math>, where <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p4.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\theta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>θ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\theta</annotation></semantics></math> are the model parameters that governs
the evolution of <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p4.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="q_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p5" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p5.1" class="ltx_p">We define the <em id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p5.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">velocity error</em> by</p>
<table id="A1.Ex9" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta_{t}(x,z):=u_{t}^{\theta}(x,z)-u_{t}(x,z)," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>:=</mo><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>θ</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta_{t}(x,z):=u_{t}^{\theta}(x,z)-u_{t}(x,z),</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p6" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p6.1" class="ltx_p">The discrete divergence operator acts on fluxes <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="v(x,z)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">v(x,z)</annotation></semantics></math> between states,
and for each state <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p6.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>x</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x</annotation></semantics></math> returns the imbalance between incoming and outgoing flow:</p>
<table id="A1.Ex10" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\operatorname{div}_{x}(v)\;=\;\sum_{z\in\mathcal{S}}\big[v(z,x)-v(x,z)\big]." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>div</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo rspace="0.280em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.391em">=</mo><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\operatorname{div}_{x}(v)\;=\;\sum_{z\in\mathcal{S}}\big[v(z,x)-v(x,z)\big].</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p6.2" class="ltx_p">In other words, <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p6.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\operatorname{div}_{x}(v)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>div</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\operatorname{div}_{x}(v)</annotation></semantics></math> equals the total inflow into state <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p6.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>x</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x</annotation></semantics></math>
minus the total outflow from <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p6.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>x</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x</annotation></semantics></math>, expressing the conservation law that
governs how probability mass moves across states.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p7" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p7.1" class="ltx_p">The evolution of the distributions is governed by the continuity equations,
also known in the Markov chain literature as the master equations:</p>
<table id="A1.Ex11" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\dot{p}_{t}+\operatorname{div}\!\big(p_{t}u_{t}\big)=0,\qquad\dot{q}_{t}+\operatorname{div}\!\big(q_{t}u_{t}^{\theta}\big)=0." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>p</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><mpadded style="width:1.216em;" width="1.216em"><mi>div</mi></mpadded><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mo rspace="2.167em">,</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>q</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><mpadded style="width:1.216em;" width="1.216em"><mi>div</mi></mpadded><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>θ</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\dot{p}_{t}+\operatorname{div}\!\big(p_{t}u_{t}\big)=0,\qquad\dot{q}_{t}+\operatorname{div}\!\big(q_{t}u_{t}^{\theta}\big)=0.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p8" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p8.1" class="ltx_p">Assume the instantaneous loss is bounded, <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0\leq\ell_{\theta}\leq B" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0\leq\ell_{\theta}\leq B</annotation></semantics></math>, and denote the training and generation risks by</p>
<table id="A1.Ex12" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R_{\mathcal{D}}(\theta)=\mathbb{E}_{\mu_{\mathcal{D}}}[\ell_{\theta}],\qquad R_{\mathrm{gen}}(\theta)=\mathbb{E}_{\mu_{\mathrm{gen}}}[\ell_{\theta}]." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="2.167em">,</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>gen</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi>gen</mi></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R_{\mathcal{D}}(\theta)=\mathbb{E}_{\mu_{\mathcal{D}}}[\ell_{\theta}],\qquad R_{\mathrm{gen}}(\theta)=\mathbb{E}_{\mu_{\mathrm{gen}}}[\ell_{\theta}].</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Claim 1</h4>

<div id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">[TV stability of path marginals]
Let <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{S}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{S}</annotation></semantics></math> be a finite state space, and let
<math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p_{t},q_{t}\in\Delta(\mathcal{S})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{t},q_{t}\in\Delta(\mathcal{S})</annotation></semantics></math> evolve according to</p>
<table id="A1.Ex13" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex13.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\dot{p}_{t}+\operatorname{div}(p_{t}u_{t})=0,\qquad\dot{q}_{t}+\operatorname{div}(q_{t}u_{t}^{\theta})=0," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>p</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>div</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mo rspace="2.167em">,</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>q</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>div</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>θ</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\dot{p}_{t}+\operatorname{div}(p_{t}u_{t})=0,\qquad\dot{q}_{t}+\operatorname{div}(q_{t}u_{t}^{\theta})=0,</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p2.1" class="ltx_p">where <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="u_{t},u_{t}^{\theta}:\mathcal{S}\times\mathcal{S}\to\mathbb{R}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>θ</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mi>ℝ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u_{t},u_{t}^{\theta}:\mathcal{S}\times\mathcal{S}\to\mathbb{R}</annotation></semantics></math> are velocity fields
satisfying <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="u_{t}(x,z)\geq 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u_{t}(x,z)\geq 0</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="u_{t}^{\theta}(x,z)\geq 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>θ</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u_{t}^{\theta}(x,z)\geq 0</annotation></semantics></math> for all <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="z\neq x" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>≠</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">z\neq x</annotation></semantics></math>, and</p>
<table id="A1.Ex14" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex14.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="u_{t}(x,x)=-\!\sum_{z\neq x}u_{t}(x,z),\qquad u_{t}^{\theta}(x,x)=-\!\sum_{z\neq x}u_{t}^{\theta}(x,z)." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0em">=</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.026em">−</mo><munder><mo lspace="0.026em" movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>≠</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></munder><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="2.167em">,</mo><msubsup><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>θ</mi></msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0em">=</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.026em">−</mo><munder><mo lspace="0.026em" movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>≠</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></munder><msubsup><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>θ</mi></msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u_{t}(x,x)=-\!\sum_{z\neq x}u_{t}(x,z),\qquad u_{t}^{\theta}(x,x)=-\!\sum_{z\neq x}u_{t}^{\theta}(x,z).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p3.1" class="ltx_p">Assume <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p_{0}=q_{0}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{0}=q_{0}</annotation></semantics></math>, and define the velocity error
<math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta_{t}:=u_{t}^{\theta}-u_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>:=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>θ</mi></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta_{t}:=u_{t}^{\theta}-u_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>. Then, for every <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p3.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s\in[0,1]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s\in[0,1]</annotation></semantics></math>,</p>
<table id="A1.Ex15" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex15.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\|q_{s}-p_{s}\|_{\TV}\;\leq\;\int_{0}^{s}\mathbb{E}_{x\sim q_{t}}\Big[\sum_{z\neq x}|\Delta_{t}(x,z)|\Big]\,dt" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>TV</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.558em" rspace="0.391em">≤</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>s</mi></msubsup><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∼</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">[</mo><mrow><munder><mo lspace="0em" movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>≠</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0em">𝑑</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\|q_{s}-p_{s}\|_{\TV}\;\leq\;\int_{0}^{s}\mathbb{E}_{x\sim q_{t}}\Big[\sum_{z\neq x}|\Delta_{t}(x,z)|\Big]\,dt</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.1" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p4" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p4.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p4.1.1" class="ltx_text">This proof follows the overall strategy of <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib29" title="" class="ltx_ref">Huang et al. ()</a></cite>, who establish the result in the continuous setting. Here, we adapt and extend their argument to the discrete case for completeness.</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p5" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p5.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p5.1.1" class="ltx_text">Let <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r_{t}:=q_{t}-p_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>:=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r_{t}:=q_{t}-p_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>. Subtracting the continuity equations</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex16" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex16.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\dot{q}_{t}+\operatorname{div}(q_{t}u_{t}^{\theta})=0,\qquad\dot{p}_{t}+\operatorname{div}(p_{t}u_{t})=0," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>q</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>div</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>θ</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mo rspace="2.167em">,</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>p</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>div</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\dot{q}_{t}+\operatorname{div}(q_{t}u_{t}^{\theta})=0,\qquad\dot{p}_{t}+\operatorname{div}(p_{t}u_{t})=0,</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p5.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p5.2.1" class="ltx_text">yields</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex17" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex17.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\dot{r}_{t}=-\operatorname{div}(q_{t}u_{t}^{\theta}-p_{t}u_{t})=-\operatorname{div}(r_{t}u_{t})-\operatorname{div}(q_{t}(u_{t}^{\theta}-u_{t}))." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>r</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">−</mo><mrow><mi>div</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>θ</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">−</mo><mrow><mi>div</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>div</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>θ</mi></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\dot{r}_{t}=-\operatorname{div}(q_{t}u_{t}^{\theta}-p_{t}u_{t})=-\operatorname{div}(r_{t}u_{t})-\operatorname{div}(q_{t}(u_{t}^{\theta}-u_{t})).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p6" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p6.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p6.1.1" class="ltx_text">With <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta_{t}:=u_{t}^{\theta}-u_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>:=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>θ</mi></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta_{t}:=u_{t}^{\theta}-u_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>, this becomes</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex18" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex18.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\dot{r}_{t}=-\operatorname{div}(r_{t}u_{t})-\operatorname{div}(q_{t}\Delta_{t})," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>r</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">−</mo><mrow><mi>div</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>div</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\dot{r}_{t}=-\operatorname{div}(r_{t}u_{t})-\operatorname{div}(q_{t}\Delta_{t}),</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p6.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p6.2.1" class="ltx_text">with initial condition <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p6.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r_{0}=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r_{0}=0</annotation></semantics></math> since <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p6.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p_{0}=q_{0}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{0}=q_{0}</annotation></semantics></math>.
Note that <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p6.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r_{t}</annotation></semantics></math> is not a probability distribution but a signed measure
satisfying <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p6.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sum_{x}r_{t}(x)=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>x</mi></msub><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum_{x}r_{t}(x)=0</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p7" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p7.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p7.1.1" class="ltx_text">The homogeneous system</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex19" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex19.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\dot{h}_{t}=-\operatorname{div}(h_{t}u_{t})" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>h</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">−</mo><mrow><mi>div</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\dot{h}_{t}=-\operatorname{div}(h_{t}u_{t})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p7.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p7.2.1" class="ltx_text">induces a time-inhomogeneous Markov evolution operator <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{t\to s}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{t\to s}</annotation></semantics></math>, defined as the linear map that propagates a distribution <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p7.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="h_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">h_{t}</annotation></semantics></math> at time <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p7.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>t</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t</annotation></semantics></math>
to its state at time <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p7.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>s</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s</annotation></semantics></math>: <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p7.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="h_{s}=S_{t\to s}h_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">h_{s}=S_{t\to s}h_{t}</annotation></semantics></math> <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib1" title="" class="ltx_ref">van, 2011</a>)</cite>.
By the variation-of-constants (Duhamel) <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib8" title="" class="ltx_ref">Bers et al., 1964</a>)</cite> formula for linear ODEs with bounded generators,
the solution of the inhomogeneous system is</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex20" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex20.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r_{s}=S_{0\to s}r_{0}-\int_{0}^{s}S_{t\to s}\,\operatorname{div}(q_{t}\Delta_{t})\,dt." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em">−</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>s</mi></msubsup><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>div</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0em">𝑑</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r_{s}=S_{0\to s}r_{0}-\int_{0}^{s}S_{t\to s}\,\operatorname{div}(q_{t}\Delta_{t})\,dt.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p7.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p7.3.1" class="ltx_text">Since <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p7.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r_{0}=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r_{0}=0</annotation></semantics></math>, this simplifies to</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex21" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex21.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="r_{s}=-\int_{0}^{s}S_{t\to s}\,\operatorname{div}(q_{t}\Delta_{t})\,dt." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo rspace="0em">=</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.055em">−</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>s</mi></msubsup><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mi>div</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo rspace="0.170em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r_{s}=-\int_{0}^{s}S_{t\to s}\,\operatorname{div}(q_{t}\Delta_{t})\,dt.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p8" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p8.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p8.1.1" class="ltx_text">According to Theorem 3.33 (Dynkin) in <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib1" title="" class="ltx_ref">van (2011)</a></cite>, the evolution operator <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{t\to s}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{t\to s}</annotation></semantics></math> is contractive, hence:</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex22" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex22.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\|S_{t\to s}\phi\|_{\TV}\leq\|\phi\|_{\TV}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ϕ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>TV</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>TV</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\|S_{t\to s}\phi\|_{\TV}\leq\|\phi\|_{\TV}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p9" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p9.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p9.1.1" class="ltx_text">Applying this with <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\phi=\operatorname{div}(q_{t}\Delta_{t})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>div</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\phi=\operatorname{div}(q_{t}\Delta_{t})</annotation></semantics></math> inside the Duhamel representation,</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex23" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex23.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="r_{s}=-\int_{0}^{s}S_{t\to s}\,\operatorname{div}(q_{t}\Delta_{t})\,dt," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo rspace="0em">=</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.055em">−</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>s</mi></msubsup><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mi>div</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo rspace="0.170em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r_{s}=-\int_{0}^{s}S_{t\to s}\,\operatorname{div}(q_{t}\Delta_{t})\,dt,</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p9.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p9.2.1" class="ltx_text">we obtain</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex24" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex24.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\|r_{s}\|_{\TV}=\Big\|\int_{0}^{s}S_{t\to s}\,\operatorname{div}(q_{t}\Delta_{t})\,dt\Big\|_{\TV}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>TV</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em" stretchy="true">‖</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo lspace="0em">∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>s</mi></msubsup><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>div</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0em">𝑑</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em" stretchy="true">‖</mo></mrow><mi>TV</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\|r_{s}\|_{\TV}=\Big\|\int_{0}^{s}S_{t\to s}\,\operatorname{div}(q_{t}\Delta_{t})\,dt\Big\|_{\TV}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p10" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p10.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p10.1.1" class="ltx_text">First, by the triangle inequality for vector-valued integrals
(i.e., <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\|\int_{0}^{s}X_{t}dt\|\leq\int_{0}^{s}\|X_{t}\|dt" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo lspace="0em">∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>s</mi></msubsup><mrow><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0em">𝑑</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.111em">≤</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo rspace="0em">∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>s</mi></msubsup><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0em">𝑑</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\|\int_{0}^{s}X_{t}dt\|\leq\int_{0}^{s}\|X_{t}\|dt</annotation></semantics></math>)</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p11" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<table id="A1.Ex25" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex25.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Big\|\int_{0}^{s}S_{t\to s}\,\operatorname{div}(q_{t}\Delta_{t})\,dt\Big\|_{\TV}\;\leq\;\int_{0}^{s}\big\|S_{t\to s}\,\operatorname{div}(q_{t}\Delta_{t})\big\|_{\TV}\,dt." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em" stretchy="true">‖</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo lspace="0em">∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>s</mi></msubsup><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>div</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0em">𝑑</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em" stretchy="true">‖</mo></mrow><mi>TV</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.558em" rspace="0.391em">≤</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo rspace="0em">∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>s</mi></msubsup><mrow><msub><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em" stretchy="true">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>div</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em" stretchy="true">‖</mo></mrow><mi>TV</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0em">𝑑</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Big\|\int_{0}^{s}S_{t\to s}\,\operatorname{div}(q_{t}\Delta_{t})\,dt\Big\|_{\TV}\;\leq\;\int_{0}^{s}\big\|S_{t\to s}\,\operatorname{div}(q_{t}\Delta_{t})\big\|_{\TV}\,dt.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p11.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p11.1.1" class="ltx_text">Second, by TV-contraction of the Markov evolution <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{t\to s}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{t\to s}</annotation></semantics></math>,</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex26" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex26.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\big\|S_{t\to s}\,\operatorname{div}(q_{t}\Delta_{t})\big\|_{\TV}\;\leq\;\big\|\operatorname{div}(q_{t}\Delta_{t})\big\|_{\TV}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em" stretchy="true">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>div</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em" stretchy="true">‖</mo></mrow><mi>TV</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.558em" rspace="0.558em">≤</mo><msub><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em" stretchy="true">‖</mo><mrow><mi>div</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em" stretchy="true">‖</mo></mrow><mi>TV</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\big\|S_{t\to s}\,\operatorname{div}(q_{t}\Delta_{t})\big\|_{\TV}\;\leq\;\big\|\operatorname{div}(q_{t}\Delta_{t})\big\|_{\TV}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p12" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p12.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p12.1.1" class="ltx_text">Combining the two displays gives</span></p>
<table id="A1.E15" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E15.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\|r_{s}\|_{\TV}\;\leq\;\int_{0}^{s}\|\operatorname{div}(q_{t}\Delta_{t})\|_{\TV}\,dt." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>TV</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.558em" rspace="0.391em">≤</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo rspace="0em">∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>s</mi></msubsup><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mi>div</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>TV</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0em">𝑑</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\|r_{s}\|_{\TV}\;\leq\;\int_{0}^{s}\|\operatorname{div}(q_{t}\Delta_{t})\|_{\TV}\,dt.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(15)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p13" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p13.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p13.1.1" class="ltx_text">For each <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p13.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x\in\mathcal{S}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x\in\mathcal{S}</annotation></semantics></math>,</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex27" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex27.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(\operatorname{div}(q_{t}\Delta_{t}))(x)=\sum_{z\neq x}\!\big(q_{t}(z)\Delta_{t}(z,x)-q_{t}(x)\Delta_{t}(x,z)\big)." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>div</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.111em">=</mo><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>≠</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(\operatorname{div}(q_{t}\Delta_{t}))(x)=\sum_{z\neq x}\!\big(q_{t}(z)\Delta_{t}(z,x)-q_{t}(x)\Delta_{t}(x,z)\big).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p13.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p13.2.1" class="ltx_text">Hence:</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex28" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex28.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\|\operatorname{div}(q_{t}\Delta_{t})\|_{\TV}=\tfrac{1}{2}\sum_{x\in\mathcal{S}}\Big|\sum_{z\neq x}(q_{t}(z)\Delta_{t}(z,x)-q_{t}(x)\Delta_{t}(x,z))\Big|\;\leq\;\sum_{x}q_{t}(x)\sum_{z\neq x}|\Delta_{t}(x,z)|." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mi>div</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>TV</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="false"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em" stretchy="true">|</mo><mrow><munder><mo lspace="0em" movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>≠</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em" rspace="0.280em" stretchy="true">|</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.391em">≤</mo><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mi>x</mi></munder><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>≠</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\|\operatorname{div}(q_{t}\Delta_{t})\|_{\TV}=\tfrac{1}{2}\sum_{x\in\mathcal{S}}\Big|\sum_{z\neq x}(q_{t}(z)\Delta_{t}(z,x)-q_{t}(x)\Delta_{t}(x,z))\Big|\;\leq\;\sum_{x}q_{t}(x)\sum_{z\neq x}|\Delta_{t}(x,z)|.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p14" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p14.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p14.1.1" class="ltx_text">By dropping the inflow terms and upper bounding with the total outflow, we obtain</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex29" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex29.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\|\operatorname{div}(q_{t}\Delta_{t})\|_{\TV}\;\leq\;\sum_{x}q_{t}(x)\sum_{z\neq x}|\Delta_{t}(x,z)|." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mi>div</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>TV</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.558em" rspace="0.391em">≤</mo><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mi>x</mi></munder><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>≠</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\|\operatorname{div}(q_{t}\Delta_{t})\|_{\TV}\;\leq\;\sum_{x}q_{t}(x)\sum_{z\neq x}|\Delta_{t}(x,z)|.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p15" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p15.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p15.1.1" class="ltx_text">Combining equation <a href="#A1.E15" title="In Proof. ‣ Claim 1 ‣ Appendix A Proofs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">15</span></a> with this bound yields</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex30" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex30.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\|q_{s}-p_{s}\|_{\TV}=\|r_{s}\|_{\TV}\;\leq\;\int_{0}^{s}\mathbb{E}_{x\sim q_{t}}\Big[\sum_{z\neq x}|\Delta_{t}(x,z)|\Big]\,dt." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>TV</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>TV</mi></msub><mo rspace="0.391em">≤</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>s</mi></msubsup><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∼</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">[</mo><mrow><munder><mo lspace="0em" movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>≠</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0em">𝑑</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\|q_{s}-p_{s}\|_{\TV}=\|r_{s}\|_{\TV}\;\leq\;\int_{0}^{s}\mathbb{E}_{x\sim q_{t}}\Big[\sum_{z\neq x}|\Delta_{t}(x,z)|\Big]\,dt.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p15.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p15.2.1" class="ltx_text">In particular, for <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p15.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s=1</annotation></semantics></math>,</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex31" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex31.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\|q_{1}-p_{1}\|_{\TV}\;\leq\;\int_{0}^{1}\mathbb{E}_{x\sim q_{t}}\Big[\sum_{z\neq x}|\Delta_{t}(x,z)|\Big]\,dt." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>TV</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.558em" rspace="0.391em">≤</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∼</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">[</mo><mrow><munder><mo lspace="0em" movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>≠</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0em">𝑑</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\|q_{1}-p_{1}\|_{\TV}\;\leq\;\int_{0}^{1}\mathbb{E}_{x\sim q_{t}}\Big[\sum_{z\neq x}|\Delta_{t}(x,z)|\Big]\,dt.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p15.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p15.3.1" class="ltx_text">This completes the proof.
∎</span></p>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Corollary 1</h4>

<div id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">[Instantaneous TV growth]
For a.e <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\in[0,1]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\in[0,1]</annotation></semantics></math>,</p>
<table id="A1.Ex32" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex32.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\frac{d}{dt}\,\|q_{t}-p_{t}\|_{\TV}\;\leq\;\mathbb{E}_{x\sim q_{t}}\Big[\sum_{z\neq x}|\Delta_{t}(x,z)|\Big]." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>TV</mi></msub></mrow><mo rspace="0.558em">≤</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∼</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">[</mo><mrow><munder><mo lspace="0em" movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>≠</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\frac{d}{dt}\,\|q_{t}-p_{t}\|_{\TV}\;\leq\;\mathbb{E}_{x\sim q_{t}}\Big[\sum_{z\neq x}|\Delta_{t}(x,z)|\Big].</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p2.1" class="ltx_p">which can be decomposed into two parts:</p>
<table id="A1.E16" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E16.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\begin{split}\frac{d}{dt}\,\|q_{t}-p_{t}\|_{\mathrm{TV}}\leq&amp;\ \mathbb{E}_{x\sim p_{t}}\!\Big[\sum_{z\neq x}|\Delta_{t}(x,z)|\Big]+\Big(\mathbb{E}_{x\sim q_{t}}\!\Big[\sum_{z\neq x}|\Delta_{t}(x,z)|\Big]-\mathbb{E}_{x\sim p_{t}}\!\Big[\sum_{z\neq x}|\Delta_{t}(x,z)|\Big]\Big)\\[3.00003pt]
\leq&amp;\ \mathbb{E}_{x\sim p_{t}}\!\Big[\sum_{z\neq x}|\Delta_{t}(x,z)|\Big]+\left\|\sum_{z\neq x}|\Delta_{t}(x,z)|\right\|_{\infty}\cdot\|q_{t}-p_{t}\|_{\mathrm{TV}}.\end{split}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mtable columnspacing="0pt" displaystyle="true" rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_right" columnalign="right"><mrow><mrow><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0.340em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>TV</mi></msub></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mphantom></mphantom></mrow></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∼</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">[</mo><mrow><munder><mo lspace="0em" movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>≠</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo mathsize="1.600em">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mpadded style="width:0.497em;" width="0.497em"><mi>𝔼</mi></mpadded><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∼</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">[</mo><mrow><munder><mo lspace="0em" movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>≠</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo mathsize="1.600em">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mpadded style="width:0.497em;" width="0.497em"><mi>𝔼</mi></mpadded><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∼</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">[</mo><mrow><munder><mo lspace="0em" movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>≠</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo mathsize="1.600em">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_right" columnalign="right"><mo>≤</mo></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∼</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">[</mo><mrow><munder><mo lspace="0em" movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>≠</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><munder><mo lspace="0em" movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>≠</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em">‖</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></msub><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>TV</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\begin{split}\frac{d}{dt}\,\|q_{t}-p_{t}\|_{\mathrm{TV}}\leq&amp;\ \mathbb{E}_{x\sim p_{t}}\!\Big[\sum_{z\neq x}|\Delta_{t}(x,z)|\Big]+\Big(\mathbb{E}_{x\sim q_{t}}\!\Big[\sum_{z\neq x}|\Delta_{t}(x,z)|\Big]-\mathbb{E}_{x\sim p_{t}}\!\Big[\sum_{z\neq x}|\Delta_{t}(x,z)|\Big]\Big)\\[3.00003pt]
\leq&amp;\ \mathbb{E}_{x\sim p_{t}}\!\Big[\sum_{z\neq x}|\Delta_{t}(x,z)|\Big]+\left\|\sum_{z\neq x}|\Delta_{t}(x,z)|\right\|_{\infty}\cdot\|q_{t}-p_{t}\|_{\mathrm{TV}}.\end{split}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(16)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p3.1" class="ltx_p">The first term reflects the <em id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p3.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">intrinsic model error</em> under <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>, while the second term quantifies the extra contribution from the <em id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p3.1.2" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">domain gap</em> between <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="q_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q_{t}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p3.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.1" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p4" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p4.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p4.1.1" class="ltx_text">By Claim <a href="#A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2" title="Claim 1 ‣ Appendix A Proofs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A</span></a>, for all <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s\in[0,1]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s\in[0,1]</annotation></semantics></math>,</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex33" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex33.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\|q_{s}-p_{s}\|_{\TV}\;\leq\;\int_{0}^{s}\mathbb{E}_{x\sim q_{t}}\Big[\sum_{z\neq x}|\Delta_{t}(x,z)|\Big]\,dt." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>TV</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.558em" rspace="0.391em">≤</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>s</mi></msubsup><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∼</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">[</mo><mrow><munder><mo lspace="0em" movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>≠</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0em">𝑑</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\|q_{s}-p_{s}\|_{\TV}\;\leq\;\int_{0}^{s}\mathbb{E}_{x\sim q_{t}}\Big[\sum_{z\neq x}|\Delta_{t}(x,z)|\Big]\,dt.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p4.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p4.2.1" class="ltx_text">The right-hand side is absolutely continuous in <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>s</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s</annotation></semantics></math>, hence so is
<math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p4.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s\mapsto\|q_{s}-p_{s}\|_{\TV}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy="false">↦</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>TV</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s\mapsto\|q_{s}-p_{s}\|_{\TV}</annotation></semantics></math>. By the fundamental theorem of calculus for
absolutely continuous functions, the derivative exists for a.e. <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p4.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>t</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t</annotation></semantics></math> and
satisfies</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex34" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex34.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\frac{d}{dt}\,\|q_{t}-p_{t}\|_{\TV}\;\leq\;\mathbb{E}_{x\sim q_{t}}\Big[\sum_{z\neq x}|\Delta_{t}(x,z)|\Big]" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>TV</mi></msub></mrow><mo rspace="0.558em">≤</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∼</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">[</mo><mrow><munder><mo lspace="0em" movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>≠</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\frac{d}{dt}\,\|q_{t}-p_{t}\|_{\TV}\;\leq\;\mathbb{E}_{x\sim q_{t}}\Big[\sum_{z\neq x}|\Delta_{t}(x,z)|\Big]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p4.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p4.3.1" class="ltx_text">.</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p5" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p5.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p5.1.1" class="ltx_text">∎</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="Thmproposition1" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_proposition">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="Thmproposition1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Proposition 1</span></span><span id="Thmproposition1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> </span>(From path-marginal TV to occupancy TV)<span id="Thmproposition1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="Thmproposition1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Thmproposition1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmproposition1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">With</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx4" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex35"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex35.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mu_{\mathcal{D}}(t,x_{t}):=\lambda(t)\,p_{t}(x_{t}),\quad\mu_{\mathrm{gen}}(t,x_{t}):=\lambda(t)\,q_{t}(x_{t})," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>:=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="1.167em">,</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi>gen</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>:=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mu_{\mathcal{D}}(t,x_{t}):=\lambda(t)\,p_{t}(x_{t}),\quad\mu_{\mathrm{gen}}(t,x_{t}):=\lambda(t)\,q_{t}(x_{t}),</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="Thmproposition1.p1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmproposition1.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">where <math id="Thmproposition1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda=\mathrm{Unif}[0,1]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>Unif</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda=\mathrm{Unif}[0,1]</annotation></semantics></math>, we have</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx5" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E17"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E17.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\big\|\mu_{\mathrm{gen}}-\mu_{\mathcal{D}}\big\|_{\TV}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em" stretchy="true">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi>gen</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi></msub></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em" stretchy="true">‖</mo></mrow><mi>TV</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\big\|\mu_{\mathrm{gen}}-\mu_{\mathcal{D}}\big\|_{\TV}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E17.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\mathbb{E}_{t\sim\mathrm{Unif}[0,1]}\;\|q_{t}-p_{t}\|_{\TV}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∼</mo><mrow><mi>Unif</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>TV</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\mathbb{E}_{t\sim\mathrm{Unif}[0,1]}\;\|q_{t}-p_{t}\|_{\TV},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(17)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E18"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E18.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\int_{0}^{1}(1-t)\,\mathbb{E}_{x\sim q_{t}}\Big[\sum_{z\neq x}|\Delta_{t}(x,z)|\Big]\,dt." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup></mstyle><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∼</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">[</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>≠</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0em">𝑑</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\int_{0}^{1}(1-t)\,\mathbb{E}_{x\sim q_{t}}\Big[\sum_{z\neq x}|\Delta_{t}(x,z)|\Big]\,dt.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(18)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.2" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p6" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p6.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p6.1.1" class="ltx_text">The difference of occupancies is</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex36" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex36.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(\mu_{\mathrm{gen}}-\mu_{\mathcal{D}})(t,x)=\lambda(t)\,\big(q_{t}(x)-p_{t}(x)\big)." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi>gen</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(\mu_{\mathrm{gen}}-\mu_{\mathcal{D}})(t,x)=\lambda(t)\,\big(q_{t}(x)-p_{t}(x)\big).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p7" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p7.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p7.1.1" class="ltx_text">By the variational characterization of total variation on the product space <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{S}\times[0,1]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{S}\times[0,1]</annotation></semantics></math>,</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex37" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex37.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\|\mu_{\mathrm{gen}}-\mu_{\mathcal{D}}\|_{\TV}=\sup_{\|f\|_{\infty}\leq 1}\int_{0}^{1}\sum_{x\in\mathcal{S}}f(x,t)\,\big(q_{t}(x)-p_{t}(x)\big)\,\lambda(t)\,dt." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi>gen</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>TV</mi></msub><mo rspace="0.1389em">=</mo><mrow><munder><mo lspace="0.1389em" movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">sup</mo><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munder><mrow><msubsup><mo rspace="0em">∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0em">𝑑</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\|\mu_{\mathrm{gen}}-\mu_{\mathcal{D}}\|_{\TV}=\sup_{\|f\|_{\infty}\leq 1}\int_{0}^{1}\sum_{x\in\mathcal{S}}f(x,t)\,\big(q_{t}(x)-p_{t}(x)\big)\,\lambda(t)\,dt.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p7.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p7.2.1" class="ltx_text">Since <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p7.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{S}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{S}</annotation></semantics></math> is finite and <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p7.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\mapsto q_{t}(x)-p_{t}(x)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">↦</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\mapsto q_{t}(x)-p_{t}(x)</annotation></semantics></math> is measurable for each <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p7.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>x</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x</annotation></semantics></math>,
the selector <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p7.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="g_{t}(x)=\operatorname{sign}(q_{t}(x)-p_{t}(x))" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>sign</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">g_{t}(x)=\operatorname{sign}(q_{t}(x)-p_{t}(x))</annotation></semantics></math> is measurable in <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p7.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>t</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t</annotation></semantics></math>,
as the sign map is Borel-measurable <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib12" title="" class="ltx_ref">Castaing and Valadier, 2006</a>)</cite>.</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p8" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p8.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p8.1.1" class="ltx_text">Hence <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f(x,t)=g_{t}(x)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f(x,t)=g_{t}(x)</annotation></semantics></math> is an admissible measurable test function on <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p8.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{S}\times[0,1]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{S}\times[0,1]</annotation></semantics></math> that
attains the inner supremum pointwise in <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p8.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>t</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t</annotation></semantics></math>.
This justifies exchanging the supremum and the integral, yielding</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex38" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex38.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\|\mu_{\mathrm{gen}}-\mu_{\mathcal{D}}\|_{\TV}=\int_{0}^{1}\|q_{t}-p_{t}\|_{\TV}\,\lambda(t)\,dt." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi>gen</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>TV</mi></msub><mo rspace="0.111em">=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo rspace="0em">∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>TV</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0em">𝑑</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\|\mu_{\mathrm{gen}}-\mu_{\mathcal{D}}\|_{\TV}=\int_{0}^{1}\|q_{t}-p_{t}\|_{\TV}\,\lambda(t)\,dt.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p9" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p9.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p9.1.1" class="ltx_text">Equivalently,</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex39" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex39.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\|\mu_{\mathrm{gen}}-\mu_{\mathcal{D}}\|_{\TV}=\mathbb{E}_{t\sim\mathrm{Unif}[0,1]}\big[\|q_{t}-p_{t}\|_{\TV}\big]." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi>gen</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>TV</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∼</mo><mrow><mi>Unif</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">[</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>TV</mi></msub><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\|\mu_{\mathrm{gen}}-\mu_{\mathcal{D}}\|_{\TV}=\mathbb{E}_{t\sim\mathrm{Unif}[0,1]}\big[\|q_{t}-p_{t}\|_{\TV}\big].</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p10" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p10.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p10.1.1" class="ltx_text">By Claim <a href="#A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2" title="Claim 1 ‣ Appendix A Proofs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A</span></a> with <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s=t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s=t</annotation></semantics></math>,</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex40" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex40.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\|q_{t}-p_{t}\|_{\TV}\;\leq\;\int_{0}^{t}\|\Delta_{\tau}\|_{\mathrm{row}\text{-}\ell_{1}}\,d\tau," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>TV</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.558em" rspace="0.391em">≤</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo rspace="0em">∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>τ</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>row</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext>-</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0em">𝑑</mo><mi>τ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\|q_{t}-p_{t}\|_{\TV}\;\leq\;\int_{0}^{t}\|\Delta_{\tau}\|_{\mathrm{row}\text{-}\ell_{1}}\,d\tau,</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p10.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p10.2.1" class="ltx_text">Taking expectation over <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p10.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\sim\mathrm{Unif}[0,1]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∼</mo><mrow><mi>Unif</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\sim\mathrm{Unif}[0,1]</annotation></semantics></math> and setting
<math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p10.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\psi(\tau):=\mathbb{E}_{x\sim q_{\tau}}\Big[\sum_{z\neq x}|\Delta_{\tau}(x,z)|\Big]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>ψ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>:=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∼</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>τ</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">[</mo><mrow><msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>≠</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>τ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\psi(\tau):=\mathbb{E}_{x\sim q_{\tau}}\Big[\sum_{z\neq x}|\Delta_{\tau}(x,z)|\Big]</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p11" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<table id="A1.EGx6" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex41"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex41.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbb{E}_{t}\!\left[\|q_{t}-p_{t}\|_{\TV}\right]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>TV</mi></msub><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbb{E}_{t}\!\left[\|q_{t}-p_{t}\|_{\TV}\right]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex41.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\mathbb{E}_{t}\!\left[\int_{0}^{t}\psi(\tau)\,d\tau\right]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>t</mi></msubsup></mstyle><mrow><mrow><mi>ψ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0em">𝑑</mo><mi>τ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\mathbb{E}_{t}\!\left[\int_{0}^{t}\psi(\tau)\,d\tau\right]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex42"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex42.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\int_{0}^{1}\!\!\int_{0}^{t}\psi(\tau)\,d\tau\,dt" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>t</mi></msubsup></mstyle><mrow><mrow><mi>ψ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0em">𝑑</mo><mi>τ</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0em">𝑑</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\int_{0}^{1}\!\!\int_{0}^{t}\psi(\tau)\,d\tau\,dt</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex43"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex43.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\int_{0}^{1}\!\!\int_{\tau}^{1}\psi(\tau)\,dt\,d\tau" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mi>τ</mi><mn>1</mn></msubsup></mstyle><mrow><mrow><mi>ψ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0em">𝑑</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0em">𝑑</mo><mi>τ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\int_{0}^{1}\!\!\int_{\tau}^{1}\psi(\tau)\,dt\,d\tau</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex44"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex44.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\int_{0}^{1}(1-\tau)\,\psi(\tau)\,d\tau" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup></mstyle><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>τ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ψ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0em">𝑑</mo><mi>τ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\int_{0}^{1}(1-\tau)\,\psi(\tau)\,d\tau</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex45"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex45.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\int_{0}^{1}(1-t)\,\mathbb{E}_{x\sim q_{t}}\Big[\sum_{z\neq x}|\Delta_{t}(x,z)|\Big]\,dt." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup></mstyle><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∼</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">[</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>≠</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0em">𝑑</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\int_{0}^{1}(1-t)\,\mathbb{E}_{x\sim q_{t}}\Big[\sum_{z\neq x}|\Delta_{t}(x,z)|\Big]\,dt.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p11.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p11.1.1" class="ltx_text">Combining this with equation <a href="#A1.E17" title="In Proposition 1 (From path-marginal TV to occupancy TV). ‣ Corollary 1 ‣ Appendix A Proofs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">17</span></a>, we obtain</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p12" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<table id="A1.Ex46" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex46.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\|\mu_{\mathrm{gen}}-\mu_{\mathcal{D}}\|_{\TV}=\mathbb{E}_{t\sim\mathrm{Unif}[0,1]}\big[\|q_{t}-p_{t}\|_{\TV}\big]\;\leq\;\int_{0}^{1}(1-t)\,\mathbb{E}_{x\sim q_{t}}\Big[\sum_{z\neq x}|\Delta_{t}(x,z)|\Big]\,dt" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi>gen</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>TV</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∼</mo><mrow><mi>Unif</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">[</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>TV</mi></msub><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em" rspace="0.280em">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.391em">≤</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo rspace="0em">∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∼</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">[</mo><mrow><munder><mo lspace="0em" movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>≠</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0em">𝑑</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\|\mu_{\mathrm{gen}}-\mu_{\mathcal{D}}\|_{\TV}=\mathbb{E}_{t\sim\mathrm{Unif}[0,1]}\big[\|q_{t}-p_{t}\|_{\TV}\big]\;\leq\;\int_{0}^{1}(1-t)\,\mathbb{E}_{x\sim q_{t}}\Big[\sum_{z\neq x}|\Delta_{t}(x,z)|\Big]\,dt</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p12.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p12.1.1" class="ltx_text">which is exactly inequality equation <a href="#A1.E18" title="In Proposition 1 (From path-marginal TV to occupancy TV). ‣ Corollary 1 ‣ Appendix A Proofs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">18</span></a>.</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p13" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p13.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p13.1.1" class="ltx_text">∎</span></p>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Theorem 1</h4>

<div id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">[DA-style generalization bound via occupancy TV]
Assume the instantaneous loss is bounded, <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0\leq\ell_{\theta}\leq B" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0\leq\ell_{\theta}\leq B</annotation></semantics></math>. Then</p>
<table id="A1.EGx7" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E19"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E19.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle R_{\mathrm{gen}}(\theta)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>gen</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle R_{\mathrm{gen}}(\theta)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E19.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\;\leq\;R_{\mathcal{D}}(\theta)\;+\;B\,\big\|\mu_{\mathrm{gen}}-\mu_{\mathcal{D}}\big\|_{\TV}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo lspace="0.558em" rspace="0.558em">≤</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo rspace="0.280em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.502em">+</mo><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em" stretchy="true">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi>gen</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi></msub></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em" stretchy="true">‖</mo></mrow><mi>TV</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\;\leq\;R_{\mathcal{D}}(\theta)\;+\;B\,\big\|\mu_{\mathrm{gen}}-\mu_{\mathcal{D}}\big\|_{\TV},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(19)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E20"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E20.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle R_{\mathrm{gen}}(\theta)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>gen</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle R_{\mathrm{gen}}(\theta)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E20.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\;\leq\;R_{\mathcal{D}}(\theta)\;+\;B\int_{0}^{1}(1-t)\,\mathbb{E}_{x\sim q_{t}}\Big[\sum_{z\neq x}|\Delta_{t}(x,z)|\Big]\,dt." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo lspace="0.558em" rspace="0.558em">≤</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo rspace="0.280em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.502em">+</mo><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup></mstyle><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∼</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">[</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>≠</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0em">𝑑</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\;\leq\;R_{\mathcal{D}}(\theta)\;+\;B\int_{0}^{1}(1-t)\,\mathbb{E}_{x\sim q_{t}}\Big[\sum_{z\neq x}|\Delta_{t}(x,z)|\Big]\,dt.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(20)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.1" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text">By TV duality, for any bounded <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>f</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f</annotation></semantics></math> with <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\|f\|_{\infty}\leq B" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\|f\|_{\infty}\leq B</annotation></semantics></math> and any probability measures <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="P,Q" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">P,Q</annotation></semantics></math>,</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex47" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex47.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\big|\mathbb{E}_{P}f-\mathbb{E}_{Q}f\big|\;\leq\;B\,\|P-Q\|_{\TV}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em" stretchy="true">|</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mi>P</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em" rspace="0.280em" stretchy="true">|</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.558em">≤</mo><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>TV</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\big|\mathbb{E}_{P}f-\mathbb{E}_{Q}f\big|\;\leq\;B\,\|P-Q\|_{\TV}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p2.2.1" class="ltx_text">Apply this with <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f=\ell_{\theta}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f=\ell_{\theta}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p2.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="P=\mu_{\mathrm{gen}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi>gen</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">P=\mu_{\mathrm{gen}}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p2.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Q=\mu_{\mathcal{D}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Q=\mu_{\mathcal{D}}</annotation></semantics></math> to obtain equation <a href="#A1.E19" title="In Theorem 1 ‣ Appendix A Proofs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">19</span></a>.
Then substitute the bound from Proposition <a href="#Thmproposition1" title="Proposition 1 (From path-marginal TV to occupancy TV). ‣ Corollary 1 ‣ Appendix A Proofs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>,</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex48" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex48.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\|\mu_{\mathrm{gen}}-\mu_{\mathcal{D}}\|_{\TV}\;=\;\mathbb{E}_{t\sim\mathrm{Unif}[0,1]}\|q_{t}-p_{t}\|_{\TV}\;\leq\;\int_{0}^{1}(1-t)\,\mathbb{E}_{x\sim q_{t}}\Big[\sum_{z\neq x}|\Delta_{t}(x,z)|\Big]\,dt," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi>gen</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>TV</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.558em" rspace="0.558em">=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∼</mo><mrow><mi>Unif</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>TV</mi></msub></mrow><mo rspace="0.391em">≤</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo rspace="0em">∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∼</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">[</mo><mrow><munder><mo lspace="0em" movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>≠</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0em">𝑑</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\|\mu_{\mathrm{gen}}-\mu_{\mathcal{D}}\|_{\TV}\;=\;\mathbb{E}_{t\sim\mathrm{Unif}[0,1]}\|q_{t}-p_{t}\|_{\TV}\;\leq\;\int_{0}^{1}(1-t)\,\mathbb{E}_{x\sim q_{t}}\Big[\sum_{z\neq x}|\Delta_{t}(x,z)|\Big]\,dt,</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p2.3.1" class="ltx_text">which yields equation <a href="#A1.E20" title="In Theorem 1 ‣ Appendix A Proofs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">20</span></a>.
∎</span></p>
</div>
</div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>Tri-mixture Velocities</h2>

<div id="A2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">For completeness, we provide the form of <math id="A2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="u_{t}(\cdot)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u_{t}(\cdot)</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A2.p1.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="u_{t}(\cdot\mid x_{0},x_{1})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u_{t}(\cdot\mid x_{0},x_{1})</annotation></semantics></math> in our tri-mixture path. Using Theorems 2 and 3 in <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib18" title="" class="ltx_ref">Gat et al. (2024)</a></cite>, we have</p>
<table id="A2.E21" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A2.E21.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="u_{t}^{i}(a,z)=\sum_{j}\alpha_{t}^{i,j}\hat{w}_{i}^{j}(a,z)+\beta_{t}^{i}\delta_{a,z_{i}}," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.111em">=</mo><mrow><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mi>j</mi></munder><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>w</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u_{t}^{i}(a,z)=\sum_{j}\alpha_{t}^{i,j}\hat{w}_{i}^{j}(a,z)+\beta_{t}^{i}\delta_{a,z_{i}},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(21)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A2.p1.2" class="ltx_p">where <math id="A2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{w}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mover accent="true"><mi>w</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{w}</annotation></semantics></math> the posterior of <math id="A2.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="w" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>w</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">w</annotation></semantics></math> is defined as,</p>
<table id="A2.E22" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A2.E22.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{w}_{t}^{j}(a,z)=\sum_{x_{0},x_{1}}w^{j}(a\mid x_{0},x_{1})p_{t}(x_{0},x_{1}\mid z)." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>w</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi><mi>j</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.111em">=</mo><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></munder><mrow><msup><mi>w</mi><mi>j</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{w}_{t}^{j}(a,z)=\sum_{x_{0},x_{1}}w^{j}(a\mid x_{0},x_{1})p_{t}(x_{0},x_{1}\mid z).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(22)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A2.p1.3" class="ltx_p">Theorem 3 gives the coefficients as <math id="A2.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha_{t}^{i,j}=\dot{\kappa}_{t}^{i,j}-\kappa_{t}^{i,j}\dot{\kappa}_{t}^{i,\ell}/\kappa_{t}^{i,\ell}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>κ</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>κ</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>κ</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo>/</mo><msubsup><mi>κ</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha_{t}^{i,j}=\dot{\kappa}_{t}^{i,j}-\kappa_{t}^{i,j}\dot{\kappa}_{t}^{i,\ell}/\kappa_{t}^{i,\ell}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A2.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta_{t}^{i}=\dot{\kappa}_{t}^{i,\ell}/\kappa_{t}^{i,\ell}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>κ</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>/</mo><msubsup><mi>κ</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta_{t}^{i}=\dot{\kappa}_{t}^{i,\ell}/\kappa_{t}^{i,\ell}</annotation></semantics></math> with <math id="A2.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ell=\arg\min_{j}\dot{\kappa}_{t}^{i,j}/\kappa_{t}^{i,j}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>arg</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><msub><mi>min</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>κ</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo>/</mo><msubsup><mi>κ</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ell=\arg\min_{j}\dot{\kappa}_{t}^{i,j}/\kappa_{t}^{i,j}</annotation></semantics></math>. In our case <math id="A2.p1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="w^{1}(a\mid x_{0},x_{1})=\delta_{x_{1}^{i}}(a),w^{\textrm{mid}}(a\mid x_{0},x_{1})=p^{i}_{\textrm{mid}}(a),w^{0}(a\mid x_{0},x_{1})=\delta_{x^{i}_{0}}(a)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>w</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn><mi>i</mi></msubsup></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>w</mi><mtext>mid</mtext></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>p</mi><mtext>mid</mtext><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>w</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn><mi>i</mi></msubsup></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">w^{1}(a\mid x_{0},x_{1})=\delta_{x_{1}^{i}}(a),w^{\textrm{mid}}(a\mid x_{0},x_{1})=p^{i}_{\textrm{mid}}(a),w^{0}(a\mid x_{0},x_{1})=\delta_{x^{i}_{0}}(a)</annotation></semantics></math> and the marginal posterior <math id="A2.p1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="w_{t}^{i,1}(a,z)=p^{i}_{1\mid t}(a|z),w^{i,\textrm{mid}}_{t}(a,z)=p^{i}_{\textrm{mid}}(a),w_{t}^{i,0}(a,z)=p^{i}_{0\mid t}(a|z)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>p</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo fence="false">|</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mtext>mid</mtext></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>p</mi><mtext>mid</mtext><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>p</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo fence="false">|</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">w_{t}^{i,1}(a,z)=p^{i}_{1\mid t}(a|z),w^{i,\textrm{mid}}_{t}(a,z)=p^{i}_{\textrm{mid}}(a),w_{t}^{i,0}(a,z)=p^{i}_{0\mid t}(a|z)</annotation></semantics></math> since <math id="A2.p1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p_{\textrm{mid}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>mid</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{\textrm{mid}}</annotation></semantics></math> is independent of the endpoints. Thus, we have,</p>
<table id="A2.E23" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A2.E23.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="u_{t}^{i}(a,z)=\alpha^{1}_{t}p_{1|t}^{i}(a\mid z)+\alpha^{\mathrm{mid}}_{t}p^{i}_{\textrm{mid}}(a)+\alpha_{t}^{0}p_{0\mid t}^{i}(a)+\beta_{t}\delta_{z}(a)," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>p</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo fence="false">|</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>mid</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>p</mi><mtext>mid</mtext><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>p</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo fence="false">|</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u_{t}^{i}(a,z)=\alpha^{1}_{t}p_{1|t}^{i}(a\mid z)+\alpha^{\mathrm{mid}}_{t}p^{i}_{\textrm{mid}}(a)+\alpha_{t}^{0}p_{0\mid t}^{i}(a)+\beta_{t}\delta_{z}(a),</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(23)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A2.p1.4" class="ltx_p">and the conditional probability velocity is given by,</p>
<table id="A2.E24" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A2.E24.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="u_{t}^{i}(a,z\mid x_{0},x_{1})=\alpha_{t}^{1}\delta_{x_{1}^{i}}(a)+\alpha_{t}^{\mathrm{mid}}p^{i}_{\textrm{mid}}(a)+\alpha_{t}^{0}\delta_{x_{0}^{i}}(a)+\beta_{t}\delta_{z}(a)." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msub><mi>δ</mi><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn><mi>i</mi></msubsup></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>mid</mi></msubsup><msubsup><mi>p</mi><mtext>mid</mtext><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msubsup><msub><mi>δ</mi><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn><mi>i</mi></msubsup></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u_{t}^{i}(a,z\mid x_{0},x_{1})=\alpha_{t}^{1}\delta_{x_{1}^{i}}(a)+\alpha_{t}^{\mathrm{mid}}p^{i}_{\textrm{mid}}(a)+\alpha_{t}^{0}\delta_{x_{0}^{i}}(a)+\beta_{t}\delta_{z}(a).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(24)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A2.p1.5" class="ltx_p">Now, our scheduler construction, as provided in Appendix <a href="#A3.SS1" title="C.1 Tri-Mixture Scheduler ‣ Appendix C Experimental Details" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C.1</span></a>, ensures <math id="A2.p1.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ell\equiv 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>≡</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ell\equiv 0</annotation></semantics></math>, and so the terms <math id="A2.p1.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p_{0\mid t}^{i}(a)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>p</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo fence="false">|</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{0\mid t}^{i}(a)</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A2.p1.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\delta_{x_{0}^{i}}(a)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn><mi>i</mi></msubsup></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\delta_{x_{0}^{i}}(a)</annotation></semantics></math> are dropped from <math id="A2.p1.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="u_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u_{t}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A2.p1.m15" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="u_{t}(\cdot\mid x_{0},x_{1})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u_{t}(\cdot\mid x_{0},x_{1})</annotation></semantics></math>, respectively.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A2.F4" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2510.04162v1/figures/three_way_scheduler.png" id="A2.F4.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:262/197;" width="262" height="197" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="A2.F4.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 4</span>: </span><span id="A2.F4.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Tri-mixture sampling scheduler.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="A3" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix C </span>Experimental Details</h2>

<section id="A3.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_font_bold ltx_title_subsection" style="font-size:120%;">C.1 Tri-Mixture Scheduler</h3>

<div id="A3.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Training with a three-way probability path requires mixing coefficients
<math id="A3.SS1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(\kappa_{0}(t),\kappa_{\mathrm{mid}}(t),\kappa_{1}(t))" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>κ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>κ</mi><mi>mid</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>κ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(\kappa_{0}(t),\kappa_{\mathrm{mid}}(t),\kappa_{1}(t))</annotation></semantics></math> that interpolate between
the source, middle, and target distributions. We adopt a
factorized scheduler where the coefficients are defined as</p>
<table id="A3.EGx8" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.E25"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E25.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\kappa_{1}(t)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>κ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\kappa_{1}(t)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E25.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=1-s(t)," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=1-s(t),</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(25)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A3.E26"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E26.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\kappa_{\mathrm{mid}}(t)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>κ</mi><mi>mid</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\kappa_{\mathrm{mid}}(t)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E26.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=r(t)\,s(t)," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=r(t)\,s(t),</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(26)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A3.E27"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E27.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\kappa_{0}(t)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>κ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\kappa_{0}(t)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E27.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\big(1-r(t)\big)s(t)," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\big(1-r(t)\big)s(t),</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(27)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.SS1.p1.2" class="ltx_p">with <math id="A3.SS1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s:[0,1]\to[0,1]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s:[0,1]\to[0,1]</annotation></semantics></math> strictly decreasing and <math id="A3.SS1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r:[0,1]\to[0,1]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r:[0,1]\to[0,1]</annotation></semantics></math> non-decreasing. Note that this
construction implies
<math id="A3.SS1.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tfrac{d}{dt}\log\kappa_{0}(t)\leq\tfrac{d}{dt}\log\kappa_{\mathrm{mid}}(t),\tfrac{d}{dt}\log\kappa_{1}(t)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>κ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>κ</mi><mi>mid</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>κ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tfrac{d}{dt}\log\kappa_{0}(t)\leq\tfrac{d}{dt}\log\kappa_{\mathrm{mid}}(t),\tfrac{d}{dt}\log\kappa_{1}(t)</annotation></semantics></math> <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib18" title="" class="ltx_ref">Gat et al., 2024</a>)</cite>.</p>
</div>
<div id="A3.SS1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.SS1.p2.1" class="ltx_p">In our experiments we use the following parametrization,</p>
<table id="A3.E28" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A3.E28.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s(t)=1-t^{p},\qquad r(t)=t^{q}," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mi>p</mi></msup></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="2.167em">,</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mi>q</mi></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s(t)=1-t^{p},\qquad r(t)=t^{q},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(28)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.SS1.p2.2" class="ltx_p">with <math id="A3.SS1.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p=2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p=2</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A3.SS1.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="q=2/3" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q=2/3</annotation></semantics></math>. Here <math id="A3.SS1.p2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s(t)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s(t)</annotation></semantics></math> controls the overall
decay from source to non-source components, while <math id="A3.SS1.p2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r(t)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r(t)</annotation></semantics></math> redistributes
the decaying mass between the middle and the target distributions.
This choice yields a unimodal, bell-shaped <math id="A3.SS1.p2.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\kappa_{\mathrm{mid}}(t)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>κ</mi><mi>mid</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\kappa_{\mathrm{mid}}(t)</annotation></semantics></math>,
peaking at <math id="A3.SS1.p2.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t^{\star}=(q/(p+q))^{1/p}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>/</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t^{\star}=(q/(p+q))^{1/p},</annotation></semantics></math>
which for <math id="A3.SS1.p2.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p=2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p=2</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A3.SS1.p2.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="q=2/3" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q=2/3</annotation></semantics></math> gives <math id="A3.SS1.p2.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t^{\star}=0.5" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t^{\star}=0.5</annotation></semantics></math>, see Figure <a href="#A2.F4" title="Figure 4 ‣ Appendix B Tri-mixture Velocities" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a>.
Consequently, the middle distribution dominates near the midpoint of
the trajectory, aligning with our design goal of exposing the model to
acoustically plausible intermediate states. At <math id="A3.SS1.p2.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t=0</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A3.SS1.p2.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t=1</annotation></semantics></math>, the path reduces to pure source and pure target distributions, respectively.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A3.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_font_bold ltx_title_subsection" style="font-size:120%;">C.2 Training and Optimization Details</h3>

<section id="A3.SS2.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Architecture.</h4>

<div id="A3.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Both Drax and Drax-flash uses a Whisper (<span id="A3.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">large-v3</span>) encoder (<math id="A3.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sim 630" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>∼</mo><mn>630</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sim 630</annotation></semantics></math>M parameters) as the audio encoder. We kept the encoder frozen during training.
The decoders uses the DiT <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib43" title="" class="ltx_ref">Peebles and Xie, 2023</a>)</cite> architecture. The Drax decoder is composed of <math id="A3.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="16" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>16</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">16</annotation></semantics></math> decoder blocks with <math id="A3.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="20" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>20</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">20</annotation></semantics></math> attention heads and <math id="A3.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1280" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>1280</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1280</annotation></semantics></math> hidden dimension with a total of <math id="A3.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="580" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>580</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">580</annotation></semantics></math>M parameters. The Drax-flash decoder contains <math id="A3.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="4" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>4</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">4</annotation></semantics></math> layers with <math id="A3.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="20" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>20</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">20</annotation></semantics></math> attention heads and <math id="A3.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1280" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>1280</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1280</annotation></semantics></math> hidden dimension with a total of <math id="A3.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="250" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>250</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">250</annotation></semantics></math>M parameters. The audio conditioned distribution <math id="A3.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p_{\textrm{mid}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>mid</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{\textrm{mid}}</annotation></semantics></math> contains a single transformer block together with a projection layer to the vocabulary size, with a total of <math id="A3.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p1.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="28" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>28</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">28</annotation></semantics></math>M parameters.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A3.SS2.SSS0.Px2" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Optimization.</h4>

<div id="A3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We train the models using the AdamW optimizer <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib37" title="" class="ltx_ref">Loshchilov and Hutter, 2019</a>)</cite> with a warmup of <math id="A3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="2500" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>2500</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2500</annotation></semantics></math> steps and a peak learning rate of <math id="A3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="3e-4" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">3e-4</annotation></semantics></math>. We use a batch size of <math id="A3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="240" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>240</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">240</annotation></semantics></math> and train Drax and Drax-flash for 800K and 250K iterations, respectively.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A3.SS2.SSS0.Px3" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Training.</h4>

<div id="A3.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">During training we sample <math id="A3.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>t</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t</annotation></semantics></math> from a uniform distribution on <math id="A3.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="[0,1]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">[0,1]</annotation></semantics></math>. We randomly drop the audio conditioning with probability of <math id="A3.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0.1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>0.1</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0.1</annotation></semantics></math>. We adapt the same tokenizer as in <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib47" title="" class="ltx_ref">Radford et al. (2023)</a></cite>, and follow <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib47" title="" class="ltx_ref">Radford et al. (2023)</a></cite> to prepend the special tokens:</p>
</div>
<div id="A3.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p2.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center"><span id="A3.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">&lt;|startoftranscript|&gt;&lt;|lang|&gt;&lt;|transcribe|&gt;&lt;|notimestamps|&gt;</span>.</p>
</div>
<div id="A3.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p3.1" class="ltx_p">We allow for random replacement of the language token according to the path <math id="A3.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{t}</annotation></semantics></math> with probability <math id="A3.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0.2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>0.2</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0.2</annotation></semantics></math>. Furthermore, with probability <math id="A3.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p3.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p_{\text{prompt}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>prompt</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{\text{prompt}}</annotation></semantics></math>, we sample a text prefix from the input utterance which remains unchanged for all <math id="A3.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p3.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>t</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t</annotation></semantics></math>. This allows for using Drax for speculative decoding with AR models.</p>
</div>
