<section id="A4.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_font_bold ltx_title_subsection" style="font-size:120%;">D.3 Extended English Benchmark Results</h3>

<div id="A4.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A4.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We provide additional Drax results for the English benchmark, under different NFE, candidate set size and scoring method setups. The results reported in Table <a href="#A4.T8" title="Table 8 ‣ D.3 Extended English Benchmark Results ‣ Appendix D Additional Results" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a> show Drax provide significant control over the accuracy-efficiency trade-off, allowing a user to select its optimal operation point.</p>
</div>
